    mem:rationale "Storage description (.well-known/solid) rdfs:seeAlso lists <../wiki/pages/>, which returns 404. The live wiki/ container set is concepts, people, places, events, organizations, procedures, working (GET wiki/ ldp:contains). The Type Index routes skos:Concept -> wiki/concepts/. D98 renamed the pages container to concepts; this seeAlso entry was not updated. Resolved against the deployed container set (operational truth, top of the ground-truth precedence). Repair direction: prose/pointer -> reality. The seeAlso is emitted by the STATIC StaticStorageDescriber config in css/config/void-description.json (storage description PATCH returns 405 / not HTTP-PATCHable) -> repo edit, not an N3 Patch." ;
    as:published "2026-05-23T22:16:31Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

